@startuml
title SC-ORD-016 — The payment service itself is down
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP
participant "Notification" as N

O ->> I : ReserveStock
I ->> O : StockReserved
note over O : CHARGING_PAYMENT
O ->> P : ChargePayment (not after: order deadline)
note over P #ECEFF1 : down: the message waits\nin its subscription
... order deadline ...
O -> O : order deadline reached
note over O : CANCELING_PAYMENT
O ->> P : CancelPayment
note over P #ECEFF1 : waits behind the charge
... review deadline ...
O -> O : review deadline reached
note over O #FFF8E1 : SUSPENDED, remembers CANCELING_PAYMENT\norder UNDER_REVIEW
O ->> N : OrderPutUnderReview
== the payment service is back ==
note over P : ChargePayment read after its instant:\npayment recorded CANCELED
note over PSP : never called
P ->> O : PaymentCanceled
note over O : handled as in CANCELING_PAYMENT
O ->> I : ReleaseReservation
note over O #FFCDD2 : COMPENSATED\norder REJECTED, TIMED_OUT
O ->> N : OrderRejected (nothing charged)
note over P : CancelPayment: already CANCELED
P ->> O : PaymentCanceled
note right of O : saga ended:\nrecorded, no effect
@enduml
